# MongoDB Connection String Format:
# mongodb+srv://username:ENCODED_PASSWORD@cluster0.xxxxx.mongodb.net/database?retryWrites=true&w=majority

# Your current password: nepal12345
# URL-encoded password: %24nepal12345%24%24

# Fix your MONGODB_URI:
# 1. Get the correct cluster name from MongoDB Atlas (should be cluster0.xxxxx.mongodb.net)
# 2. Replace $ signs in password with %24
# 3. Example: mongodb+srv://saruna:%24nepal12345%24%24@cluster0.xxxxx.mongodb.net/evertrend?retryWrites=true&w=majority
